text.section:
A person is ineligible to receive a supplier's permit if:

The person has been convicted of a felony under the laws of the Commonwealth or any other state or of the United States;


The person has submitted an application for a license under this chapter that contains false information;


The person is a Board member, employee of the Department, or a member of the immediate household of a Board member or Department employee;


The person is an entity in which a person described in subdivision 1, 2, or 3 is an officer, director, principal, or managerial employee;


The firm or corporation employs a person who participates in the management or operation of casino gaming authorized under this chapter; or


A prior permit issued to such person to own or operate casino gaming establishments or supply goods or services to a gaming operation under this chapter or any laws of any other jurisdiction has been revoked.
